  "body": "A rare opportunity to secure a brand-new home in one of the North Shore's most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nSet on Lake Road in desirable Takapuna, this boutique development comprises just eight contemporary three-level residences, Lot1 and Lot8 offering 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms while lot2-lot7 offering 3 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms, with thoughtfully designed layouts that maximise space, functionality and modern living.\r\n\r\nEnjoy easy access to Takapuna, Hauraki, Belmont and Devonport, with beaches, cafés, restaurants, shopping and everyday amenities all close by.\r\n\r\nFor families, the location also provides access to sought-after local schooling and the wider Takapuna/Devonport lifestyle.\r\nEach home features three well-planned levels, providing excellent separation between living and bedroom spaces.\r\n\r\nWith floor areas ranging from approximately 122.7m² to 152.6m², there is a choice to suit different lifestyles and budgets.\r\n\r\nLot 1 - The View\r\n\r\nApprox. 152.6m² floor area\r\nBest sea views within the development\r\nGenerous three-level layout\r\n\r\nLots 2-4 - The Balanced Choice\r\n\r\nApprox. 127.1m² floor area\r\n3 bedrooms | 3 bathrooms\r\nExcellent balance of space and affordability\r\n\r\nLots 5-7 - Exceptional Entry Value\r\n\r\nApprox. 122.7m² floor area\r\n3 bedrooms | 3 bathrooms\r\nSmart, low-maintenance design\r\n\r\nLot 8 - The Premium Package\r\n\r\nApprox. 148.7m² floor area\r\nLarger landholding\r\nAdditional car parks\r\nOne of the most substantial homes in the development\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your first home, a smart investment or a low-maintenance property close to the coast, these homes offer an exceptional combination of location, quality and value.",
